# The only ingress of the local runner (compose.dev.yml, service runner-dev-proxy), mirroring Caddy on the VPS
# (`https://runner.<domínio>/`, server/compose.leitor.yml). Local tests only: plain HTTP on the dev network.
{
	admin off
	auto_https off
	persist_config off
}

:8080 {
	# Coarse guard well above the runner's own 1 MiB limit: the runner answers 413 itself (Caddy turns its own
	# limit into a 502 mid-proxy, which clients can't tell from a dead upstream).
	request_body {
		max_size 8MB
	}
	reverse_proxy runner-dev:8080 {
		transport http {
			read_timeout 60s
			write_timeout 60s
		}
	}
	log {
		output stderr
		level WARN
	}
}
